  "about": "Full-stack AI engineer by day, technology explorer by passion. I'm on a mission to build intelligent software experiences that are as scalable as they are impactful. With a passion for turning ideas into real-world products, I enjoy crafting everything from seamless user interfaces and powerful backend systems to AI-driven applications that solve meaningful problems.\nWith 10+ years of experience across healthcare, insurance, retail, e-commerce, manufacturing, logistics, telecommunications, and enterprise technology, I've learned how to bring together software engineering, cloud platforms, data, and artificial intelligence to create solutions that make a difference. Whether it's designing elegant frontend experiences, building high-performance APIs, architecting scalable systems, or developing AI-powered workflows, I enjoy taking concepts from imagination to production.\nWhen I'm not building applications or experimenting with the latest AI breakthroughs, you might find me exploring new frameworks, optimizing system performance, improving developer workflows, or discovering better ways to make technology smarter and more efficient. I love working at the intersection of creativity and engineering where clean code meets intelligent solutions.\n\nI enjoy working with technologies like JavaScript/TypeScript, C#, Python, Java, JavaScript Frameworks(React, Angular, Vue), SQL, Spark, AWS, Azure, GCP, Docker, Kubernetes, LangChain, LangGraph, Azure OpenAI and GPT models. My toolbox includes full-stack development, backend engineering, cloud-native architectures, Generative AI, LLM applications, RAG systems and AI agents \nWhether it's creating a user-friendly web application, designing a scalable backend platform, building an intelligent AI assistant, or transforming complex data into actionable insights, I enjoy solving challenging problems where technology, innovation, and business impact come together.\n\nI'm always curious, always learning, and always building. Looking to collaborate with teams that are creating the next generation of intelligent products and experiences. Let's build something smarter, scalable, and impactful together!",
